<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32828" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκρηγμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>piece torn off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκρήγματα τρυχίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					78
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>broken bed of a torrent, ravine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.20.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>breaking forth</i> of a stream, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					1.5.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sluice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PEdgar
				30.16
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγρ-,</span>
			<span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				5.488
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχρ</span>-, <span class="entity">iii
			B.C.</span>); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκχρημα.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>eruption, bedsore,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.7
			</span></i> (pl.).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
